• You will, with appropriate guidance, deliver actionable insights that inform future campaigns and show the clients how to improve effectiveness.&nbsp; &nbsp;

• Collaborate proactively with the wider client team and other teams within Essence Mediacom, to implement measurement &amp; analytics. &nbsp;

• Play an important part in collating and reporting incrementality results from Meta, Google and other media channels &nbsp;

• Evaluate the statistical robustness of measurement solutions and iterate on them as needed to optimize performance and feasibility &nbsp;

Skills and Experience &nbsp;

